WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.2 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand strategy and promise

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your brand promise is the experience you commit to deliver, from your very first activity or sale.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Make a promise you can keep at your current size.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Note the proof points you will measure, and when.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. List the claims you will not make.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write the brand platform for what you are building.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
